  "summary": "依次使用 multipliers，每次从 nums 左端或右端取一个数相乘并移除，求 m 次后的最大总分。",
  "insight": "第 step 次已从左取 left 个，则从右已取 step-left 个，右端下标可直接算出。二维 DP 只需记录 step 与 left。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "乘数使用顺序固定",
    "nums 可能有负数",
    "右端下标为 n-1-(step-left)"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "operation-left-count-dp",
      "title": "操作步数与左取数量 DP",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用已取总数推导右侧状态，消除显式右指针。",
      "steps": [
        "memo[step][left]",
        "leftChoice=nums[left]*mult[step]+dfs(step+1,left+1)",
        "rightIndex=n-1-(step-left)，rightChoice 类似；取最大，step==m 返回零"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(m²)",
        "space": "O(m²)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/operation-left-count-dp/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/operation-left-count-dp/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/operation-left-count-dp/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
